  "dom_id": "step-q135555",
  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "In a particular country, there are two groups of people: those who live in the cities and those who live in the countryside. A study has shown that each decade \n\n- $12%$ of people who lived in the cities relocate to the countryside, and\n\n- $28%$ of people who lived in the countryside relocate to the cities.\n\nWhich of the following tables describes how these people change their preferences each year?",
